## Shared Workflow Protocol

The following operating conventions are imported from the Tower Crane hub and float on HEAD —
edits ratified there reach this project automatically. The first launch triggers a one-time
import-approval dialog; accept it (see `FIRST_RUN.md`). The one line below indirects through this
project's own `.claude/hub_pointer.md` (gitignored, regenerated per host — never hand-edit it) to
the real per-piece import lines, so this file itself never bakes in an absolute path to the hub.
To opt a piece out, edit its line inside `.claude/hub_pointer.md` (the shared checker will note
the drift, but it is not blocked) — that file is regenerated wholesale on the next `"connect
project"`/`relocate.py` pass, so a manual opt-out there is not durable across a hub move; file a
registry-update note if it needs to stick.

